[{"title":"送董孟吉 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"日午来过到日昏，短蓑钓石坐能温。\n不惭活水贫家淡，也劝山瓢带月吞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读文山别集 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"感慨文山别集章，白头老泪几淋浪。\n若言君父无情者，除是当年赵子昂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读文山别集 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"殷士周家亦可推，大元此老杀何为。\n我知世祖终宽厚，天授非人识者谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读文山别集 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"神在知几道亦行，存亡进退古今情。\n堂堂如此文山辈，要亦人间万古英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静学卷 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"天机满眼欲谁看，到处逢人一语难。\n此学平生真问我，无弦琴自不须弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静学卷 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"妙极吾心果到时，傍花随柳也无诗。\n五经若谓真糟粕，只恐人间未尽知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11315,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静学卷 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"太极乾坤自古今，许将图说到谁深。\n白头万古翻